      137.04,
      419.11,
      295.16,
      441.2
    ],
    "text": "My No.: KUDS/LND/01/ACQ/34.Land Ministry No.: 4/3/15/2017/VE/393.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      453.92,
      295.31,
      523.99
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice to you, that the Minister of MahavaliDevelopment Envernment duly ordered, under Sub-section 1of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act as amended by theLand Acquisition (Amended) Act, No.28 of 1964, and theGovernment intends to acquire the following land which isrequired for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      533.11,
      274.9,
      543.19
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land/Servitude to be Acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      554.72,
      295.07,
      564.8
    ],
    "text": "To be distributed among the victims of sudden distresses.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      578.72,
      295.46,
      648.8
    ],
    "text": "Lots 01 and 02, in Plan No. R/322 prepared bySuperintendent of Surveys, Ratnapura, situated in the villageof Pathberiya, in the Divisional Secretariat Division ofKuruwita in Ratnapura District, Sabaragamuwa Province andcontaining in extent 1.8401 Hectares and 3.2196 Hectaresrespectively.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      662.76,
      295.16,
      696.8
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01Name of the Land: Meegastenna watta; Original Ownership:Pussallawa Plantation Limited, 590, Galle Road, Colombo 03;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
